Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.68,0:00:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just four little level 45 kids. Wipe them out and be done with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever seen "kids" like this reach level 45?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.23,0:00:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be fooled by their random appearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.98,0:00:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's finish this quickly. Territory war is about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.07,0:00:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle, please let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.69,0:00:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling "Uncle"!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.24,0:00:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't let them go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.95,0:00:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Level 45 clearly means they've accepted a threshold mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.62,0:00:38.91,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}One of us is their target.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.74,0:00:38.41,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Meow.\N[Just focust on running away.]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.53,0:00:39.16,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.03,0:00:41.04,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Even though they're low level, we still have to take them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.28,0:00:39.91,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.04,0:00:41.04,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Why can I understand that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.29,0:00:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What now? Who goes there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.16,0:00:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Awen, you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.67,0:00:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.80,0:00:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.43,0:00:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,After them!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.01,0:00:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch them!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.65,0:01:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep running forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.51,0:01:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect me! I need five uninterrupted seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.76,0:01:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one more teleport charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.22,0:01:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.14,0:01:44.43,Default,,860,0,0,,Xiaohei! Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.48,0:01:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're running out of time...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.61,0:01:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Interrupt it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.57,0:02:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.87,0:02:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Only two kilometers away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.08,0:02:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.95,0:02:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't we log out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.04,0:02:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we've engaged in combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.43,0:02:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We need two minutes\Nout of combat to log out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.01,0:02:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Found them! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.22,0:02:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to dodge! Don't engage!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.86,0:02:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.91,0:02:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's "Tracking"! That means we can't break combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.58,0:02:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The skill lasts at least ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.37,0:02:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Logging out isn't realistic anymore! We need to fight back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.29,0:02:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.46,0:02:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This way! The terrain is complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.68,0:03:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't that guy just take us out directly?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.68,0:03:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, he's underestimating us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.54,0:03:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, do you see them?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.04,0:03:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,One of those four is our target, I'll leave it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.96,0:03:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.33,0:03:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast them! Don't let them break combat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.54,0:03:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Fall back! Everyone below level 60, fall back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.63,0:03:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He's hunting!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.34,0:03:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.55,0:03:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Healer! Stall him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.72,0:03:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Healer my ass! He oneshots everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.18,0:03:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mission complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.02,0:03:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Leveled up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.44,0:03:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, leveling through roaming combat should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.04,0:04:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.79,0:04:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Gen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.59,0:04:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Level 145?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.13,0:04:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there a player this high level?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.18,0:04:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hope there aren't any more...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.24,0:04:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.97,0:05:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't I kill them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So scary...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.68,0:05:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Over a hundred?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.90,0:05:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Are all of these over level 100!?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.12,0:05:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Gen!!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.34,0:05:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Shanxin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.44,0:05:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.67,0:06:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.43,0:06:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.78,0:07:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop chasing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.37,0:07:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.33,0:07:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Tracking landed. He can't break combat for twenty minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.25,0:07:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, share it with the whole team and open the Barrier Gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.29,0:07:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that necessary? The territory war is about to start!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.34,0:07:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If we go to the territory war now, \Nwe already know what'll happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.38,0:07:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the fun in that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.22,0:07:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is clearly more interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't beat him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.06,0:08:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for my artifact, I'd have died hundreds of times already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.02,0:08:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're saying we're not safe either?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.19,0:08:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we playing this game to be safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.86,0:08:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But, come to think of it...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.90,0:08:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If he really could take out all seven of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.99,0:08:13.45,Default,,0,0,80,,then he'd be the highest-level player on the server.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.59,0:08:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\pos(1178,694)}“Logout unavailable”
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.84,0:08:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your tracking skill's accuracy is way too low!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.59,0:08:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a hundred-meter range. What more do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.51,0:08:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't find him like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.30,0:08:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Confirmed, he's in the tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.22,0:08:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't leave this area now. He must be really anxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.23,0:08:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's extremely fast. The barrier lasts thirty minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.77,0:08:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the barrier's gone, we might not be able to catch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.57,0:08:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He's as fast as us, but he's way too agile.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.03,0:08:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,In this terrain, we can't catch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.82,0:08:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,On open ground, he wouldn't be able to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.70,0:08:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the main tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.33,0:09:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Liusuan, Luanbu, Xiaorui. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.33,0:09:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You three handle containment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.16,0:09:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Geshao, Axian, Tuobi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.58,0:09:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You three use area of effect slows.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.00,0:09:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,To be safe, stack it three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.88,0:09:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about wasting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.75,0:09:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.75,0:09:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't we log out yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.84,0:09:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He was hit by the tracking skill. You can see it on his status.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.34,0:09:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Eighteen minutes left. Plus, they used a barrier item.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.47,0:09:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't leave this area for half an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.27,0:09:24.02,Default,,220,0,0,,Xiaohei probably doesn't check the skill panel, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.56,0:09:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If he can avoid further contact,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.15,0:09:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,then in eighteen minutes he'll be able to log out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.81,0:09:31.07,Default,,0,550,0,,Can we tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.23,0:09:33.74,Default,,0,0,70,,No, there's no way to contact someone from outside the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.86,0:09:36.70,Default,,0,0,70,,It's all up to him. There's nothing we can do to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.66,0:09:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But there is one advantage now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.41,0:09:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.28,0:09:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Without us splitting the XP,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.50,0:09:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll level up really fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.58,0:09:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you take out his teammates first?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.71,0:09:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't know it'd turn out like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.54,0:09:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously we'd take out anyone we could.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.42,0:09:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,None of us can die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.09,0:09:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If we do, he'll become incredibly powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.55,0:09:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.63,0:09:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,One minute left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.13,0:10:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven level 100s ganging up on one level-50.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.85,0:10:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is us being cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.14,0:10:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What exclusive item do you think he has? I'm really curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.27,0:10:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's reaction speed. He might have an item that enhances that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.06,0:10:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,None of us are short on items.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.98,0:10:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,His mechanics are what really matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.86,0:10:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,After we catch him...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.57,0:10:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,let's add him as a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.53,0:10:21.12,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.79,0:10:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't get out. Can't log out either...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.18,0:10:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They're afraid of me leveling up...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.01,0:10:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Low levels aren't a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.72,0:10:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I can't escape...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.10,0:10:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.98,0:10:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey hey hey! Go easy on those! That's a rare item!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.31,0:10:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, it's those are just a distraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.87,0:11:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.70,0:11:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.21,0:11:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What did Xiaohei get hit with?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.42,0:11:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea. I can't see anything unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.34,0:11:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there! Go go go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.72,0:11:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn't he leveling up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.24,0:11:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready! Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.26,0:12:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.34,0:12:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't that guy die?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.97,0:12:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a passive skill. After being killed, the killer gets a debuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.68,0:12:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now it shows "Heavy."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.35,0:12:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But why isn't Xiaohei leveling up yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.49,0:12:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Only five minutes left!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.13,0:12:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.26,0:12:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect that guy could revive. There's actually a skill like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.68,0:12:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn't Xiaohei leveling up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.43,0:12:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What does "five minutes" refer to?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.65,0:12:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.36,0:12:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.23,0:12:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.16,0:13:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.96,0:13:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.54,0:13:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't 1v1 him! Watch the heals!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.30,0:13:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get the upperhand! Stall him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.76,0:13:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Heal! After him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.48,0:13:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.37,0:13:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come any closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.45,0:13:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.25,0:13:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Where to?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.00,0:13:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.12,0:13:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He's close by. His ability has a short range.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.83,0:14:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.17,0:14:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The skill he got hit with earlier probably suppresses leveling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.42,0:14:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a skill like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.76,0:14:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.22,0:14:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He should still have gotten the XP, but he can't level while the debuff is active.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.47,0:14:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,They must've been counting down the timelimit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.18,0:14:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If Xiaohei can hold out,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.77,0:14:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll level up like crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.00,0:14:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out! A projectile!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.85,0:14:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Use this item first!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.64,0:14:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.15,0:15:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He's moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.53,0:15:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop chasing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.35,0:16:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Heal, stall him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.83,0:17:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.09,0:17:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Add me as a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.13,0:17:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,One minute left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.89,0:17:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.63,0:17:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be bad if he actually\Nturned the tables on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.31,0:17:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope we run into you again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.53,0:17:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.41,0:18:02.58,Default,,0,700,0,,Mas...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.79,0:18:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.21,0:18:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.21,0:18:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.17,0:18:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'm taking this one with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.88,0:18:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Level 13?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.09,0:18:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of people are these!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.67,0:18:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.34,0:18:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him out first!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.34,0:18:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.77,0:19:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.52,0:19:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.52,0:19:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.19,0:19:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking him. Here's an item as compensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.69,0:19:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.37,0:19:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So little damage...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.67,0:19:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't lose any HP.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.67,0:19:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that iron ball an artifact too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.88,0:19:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, see what he gave us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.26,0:19:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So greedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.30,0:19:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going to look?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.59,0:19:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, look, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.93,0:19:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it black?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.76,0:19:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We must have been shut out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.68,0:19:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That was Xiaohei's master just now...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.52,0:19:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And they won't let us watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.40,0:19:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I really want to know what they're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.90,0:19:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.86,0:19:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.82,0:20:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Was the game fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.80,0:20:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,While you were doing this quest, were you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.10,0:20:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.98,0:20:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If this were a real mission, they'd really all be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.31,0:20:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I can't do anything. I have to rely on them for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.69,0:20:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,All I can do is fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.40,0:20:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But I couldn't even protect them...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.32,0:20:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're good at fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.33,0:20:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.70,0:20:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You were happy not because of the mission, but because you were with your friends, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.00,0:21:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted to become an Executor just so you could follow your master.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.18,0:21:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I designed this mission. I thought you might not complete it,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.75,0:21:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but I didn't expect you to fail so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.81,0:21:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't even get to experience how hard the follow-up dungeon missions are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.52,0:21:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is what an Executor's daily life is like.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.11,0:21:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.32,0:21:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you feel happy when you do missions, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.99,0:21:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.53,0:21:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why do you do them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.53,0:21:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it's my responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.95,0:21:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it can be my responsibility too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.08,0:21:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The Guild is very strong right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.87,0:21:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not yet time for little ones like you to bear that responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.13,0:21:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what do you want to do most right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.09,0:21:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,When I ask you that,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.26,0:21:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,what's the first thought that comes to your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.65,0:22:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.90,0:22:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to learn to read with Xiaobai.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.49,0:22:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.34,0:22:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do that, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.21,0:22:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.62,0:22:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.07,0:22:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.29,0:22:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.97,0:22:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just like before.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.93,0:22:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You know? In human households,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.10,0:22:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,the kids go to school and the adults go to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.14,0:22:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Then after school, I'll come home too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.98,0:22:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What's "after school"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.48,0:22:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll... find out once you've learned to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.49,0:22:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.12,0:22:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Meeting and parting, joy and sadness
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.57,0:22:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If one day you truly want to become an Executor, come take the test again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.95,0:22:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.12,0:22:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Excitement and confusedness, hope and despair
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.62,0:22:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.04,0:23:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't he wake up?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.30,0:23:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Doesn't matter what tomorrow will be like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.67,0:23:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You've made a lot of good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.42,0:23:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.38,0:23:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Be with me, singing together softly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.75,0:23:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Treasure them well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.17,0:23:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.26,0:23:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}On a quiet night, we're singing a quiet song
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.10,0:23:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}You softly tell me about your dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.61,0:23:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}On this starless, moonless night
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.65,0:23:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I'm here by your side
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.80,0:23:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like he finally mastered the new space.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.23,0:23:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, seems like he's adapted.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.05,0:23:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}There's too much of sweet, bitter and sour
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.14,0:24:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}You forgot about joy and sadness
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.19,0:24:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}My happiness is in your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.32,0:24:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Be with me, don't wander anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.20,0:24:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}On a quiet night, we're singing a quiet song
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.91,0:24:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}You softly tell me about your dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.42,0:24:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Tonight, when the whole world is sleeping
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.59,0:24:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I'm here by your side
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.64,0:24:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Doesn't matter what tomorrow will be like
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.89,0:24:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Be with me, singing together softly
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.28,0:24:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.03,0:24:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Dongdong...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.45,0:24:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,is missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.04,0:25:04.42,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Stay with me aruite yukou ishikoro wo kette
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.42,0:25:09.16,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Yukisaki wa kitto kimagure demo 
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.16,0:25:13.86,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hana no kaori wo ryoute ni
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.86,0:25:20.06,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,kore kara deau kimi e to
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.06,0:25:26.21,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Wait for me hanashi wo shiyou kata wo narabete
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.21,0:25:31.01,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hajimemashite wa gikochinaku temo
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.01,0:25:35.69,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mochiyotta hako aketara
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.69,0:25:42.21,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Tsumekon da yume wo wakeaou
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.21,0:25:53.53,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mata ashita tte atarimae ni kawaseru hibi ga
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.53,0:25:58.95,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Itoshikute hakanasugite
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.95,0:26:03.99,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Omoi wa kitto kienai
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.99,0:26:15.22,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Sora wo nagareru kumo ni wa oitsukenai kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.22,0:26:20.77,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Ame ni natte hana wo tsukete kitto boku wo yonderu
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.77,0:26:27.61,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Kitto boku wo yonderu
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.04,0:25:04.42,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Stay with me - let's walk on, kicking pebbles as we go
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.42,0:25:09.16,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Our destination may be whimsical
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.16,0:25:13.86,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,But with the scent of flowers in both hands
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.86,0:25:20.06,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,I’ll carry it to the you I’ve yet to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.06,0:25:26.21,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Wait for me — let’s talk, side by side
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.21,0:25:31.01,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Even if our first “hello” is a little awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.01,0:25:35.69,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,When we open the boxes we’ve brought
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.69,0:25:42.21,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Let’s share the dreams we’ve packed inside
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.21,0:25:53.53,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,The days when we can casually say “See you tomorrow”
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.53,0:25:58.95,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Are so precious and so fleeting
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.95,0:26:03.99,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Omoi wa kitto kienai\NThose feelings will never fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.99,0:26:15.22,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,We can’t catch up to the clouds drifting across the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.22,0:26:20.77,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,But they’ll turn to rain, bloom into flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.77,0:26:27.61,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,And surely, they’re calling out to me
